하지 아니하여 청구주장의 타당성이 인정되지 아니한다.라. 따라서 이 건 심판청구는국세기본법 제81조및 제65조 제1항 제2호 및 제3호의 규정에 의하여 주문과 같이 결정한다.【별 지】각 과세기간별 종합소득세 과세내용<table border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"> <tr> <td colspan="4" height="29" valign="middle" width="519"> <p> <span> </span> </p> </td> <td height="29" valign="middle" width="130"> <p class='style-name:"바탕글"; margin-left:0.0pt; margin-right:0.0pt; margin-top:0.0pt; margin-bottom:0.0pt; text-align:justify; text-indent:0.0pt; line-height:160%; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:새굴림; letter-spacing:0.0pt; font-weight:"normal"; font-style:"normal"; color:#000000;'> <span> (단위 : 원) </span> </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td height="29" valign="middle" width="130"> <p class='style-name:"바탕글"; margin-left:0.0pt; margin-right:0.0pt; margin-top:0.0pt; margin-bottom:0.0pt; text-align:justify; text-indent:0.0pt; line-height:160%; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:새굴림; letter-spacing:0.0pt; font-weight:"normal"; font-style:"normal"; color:#000000;'> <span> 구 분 </span> </p> </td> <td height="29" valign="middle" width="130"> <p class='style-name:"바탕글"; margin-left:0.0pt; margin-right:0.0pt; margin-top:0.0pt; margin-bottom:0.0pt; text-align:justify; text-indent:0.0pt; line-height:160%; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:새굴림; letter-spacing:0.0pt; font-weight:"normal"; font-style:"normal"; color:#000000;'> <span> ’88년 </span> </p> </td> <td height="29" valign="middle" width="130"> <p class='style-name:"바탕글"; margin-left:0.0pt; margin-right:0.0pt; margin-top:0.0pt; margin-bottom:0.0pt; text-align:justify; text-indent:0.0pt; line-height:160%; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:새굴림; letter-spacing:0.0pt; font-weight:"normal"; font-style:"normal"; color:#000000;'> <span> ’89년 </span> </p> </td> <td height="29" valign="middle" width="130"> <p class='style-name:"바탕글"; margin-left:0.0pt; margin-right:0.0pt; margin-top:0.0pt; margin-bottom:0.0pt; text-align:justify; text-indent:0.0pt; line-height:160%; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:새굴림; letter-spacing:0.0pt; font-weight:"normal"; font-style:"